# libSceAgc — GPU command-buffer / shader ABI (#27 GPU Step 2/3).
# Start = evo_agc_probe.c's kSyms (minus the two sceAgcDriver* ones).
# Extend as pp_agc.c / evo_rmlui_render_agc.cpp need more (a link error names
# the missing symbol). Full ABI: third_party/SharpProspero .../Interop/Agc/SceAgc.cs.
#
# EVERY name here becomes a POSITIONAL (unconditional DT_NEEDED) import from
# libSceAgc.prx in the eboot. A name whose NID does not resolve on the console
# firmware makes the dynamic loader REJECT the whole module -> "Game or App
# Error" / CE-108255-1 before main(), no log ("crashed before KStuff pause").
# So: add a symbol ONLY when an object actually imports it. `sceAgcDcbDrawIndexOffset`
# was listed here speculatively in #28 (93ce6ec), never called (the geo path uses
# sceAgcDcbDrawIndex), and its unresolved NID bricked every player build at load
# for a whole session. package-app.sh now cross-checks this file against the
# objects' undefined symbols and fails on a dead entry.
sceAgcInit
sceAgcGetRegisterDefaults
sceAgcCreateShader
sceAgcLinkShaders
sceAgcDcbSetCxRegistersIndirect
sceAgcDcbSetUcRegistersIndirect
sceAgcDcbSetShRegistersIndirect
sceAgcCbSetShRegisterRangeDirect
sceAgcDcbDrawIndexAuto
sceAgcDcbSetFlip
sceAgcSuspendPoint
# #28 Phase 4 - GPU geometry (indexed draws)
sceAgcDcbSetCxRegisterDirect
sceAgcDcbSetIndexSize
sceAgcDcbSetIndexBuffer
sceAgcDcbSetIndexCount
sceAgcDcbDrawIndex
